      en: "Hawally Amusement Park, commonly known as Hawally Park, is one of the most established and well-known recreational landmarks in Kuwait. It is situated in the Hawalli Governorate, which is among the country’s busiest commercial and residential districts. The park was designed to offer families a comprehensive range of entertainment options within an urban setting. It features a diverse selection of outdoor rides, including roller coasters and carousels, as well as extensive indoor play areas that are essential during the extremely hot summer months. Beyond the rides, the park hosts various restaurants, cafes, and event spaces suitable for private celebrations and community gatherings. Historically, it was one of the first modern amusement parks in Kuwait and has catered to generations of visitors over several decades. The park's architecture blends modern entertainment themes with local cultural touches. Despite competition from newer and larger theme parks, Hawally Park remains a staple of social life due to its central location and nostalgic appeal. it continues to be a primary destination for weekend outings and festive occasions in the region.",
